## Model card

- **Name:** Cat Jam (Free-tier wording: `cat-jam-free` on OpenCode, `stealth/cat-jam` on Vercel AI Gateway).
- **Short description:** Stealth reasoning model for coding and agentic tasks, emphasising low-latency inference. Alias `cat-jam-free` is the free tier on OpenCode; `stealth/cat-jam` is the model name on Vercel AI Gateway.
- **Provider / access:** Vercel AI Gateway (`stealth/cat-jam`), OpenCode (`cat-jam-free`). Chat Completions API is supported; Responses API also available on Vercel AI Gateway.
- **Release / knowledge:** Released 2026-10-15; knowledge cutoff not disclosed.
- **IDs:** `stealth/cat-jam` (Vercel), `cat-jam-free` (OpenCode). No Free ID exists on OpenCode Zen; the OpenCode free tier ID is `cat-jam-free`.
- **Context window:** 1,000,000 tokens total (verified via Vercel model page and Command Code); max output 131,072 tokens.
- **Modalities:** Text in, text out; reasoning yes; tool calls yes; JSON mode yes (structured outputs).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-16):** $0.00 input / $0.00 output / $0.00 cached per 1M tokens (Free during stealth period). Free-tier privacy caveat: prompts and responses may be used for training and model improvement (Vercel); OpenCode notes zero data retention for the free tier.
- **Architecture:** Proprietary stealth model; parameter count, MoE configuration, and open-weights license not disclosed.

